### Orchestrator-Workers 调试（需后端 8100 已启动）
### 跨能力：kb → search（替换 kbId）
POST http://localhost:8100/ai/agent/orchestrate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input": "根据知识库总结 Java 三大特性，并搜索补充一句与 Java 相关的近期资讯",
  "kbId": "d8247234-b4db-4cbc-83d5-58e472b1dad2",
  "maxSteps": 6
}

### 无 kbId 约束：不得成功跑 retrieve_kb RAG
POST http://localhost:8100/ai/agent/orchestrate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input": "从知识库查找 Java 三大特性是什么",
  "maxSteps": 4
}

### maxSteps 上限
POST http://localhost:8100/ai/agent/orchestrate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input": "先查知识库再搜索再整理成三点，尽量多步完成",
  "kbId": "d8247234-b4db-4cbc-83d5-58e472b1dad2",
  "maxSteps": 2
}

### 回归：单次 Routing（已迁至 NDJSON，见 agent-route.http）
# POST http://localhost:8100/ai/agent/route  → application/x-ndjson
